(6849996, 1031086, 72318, '<td valign="top">Interested in how you got to get the people to stand out in the correct exposure bracket between shadow and highlight (noticeably the child and mother walking half in half out, and the lady''s bag and leg).  I assume selective dodging (/burning) - but how do you make it look so natural / the transition not really count?<br/> <br/>Oh and this has to be jagar''s work if i''m not mistaken ;)</td>', 'Interested in how you got to get the people to stand out in the correct exposure bracket between shadow and highlight (noticeably the child and mother walking half in half out, and the lady''s bag and leg).  I assume selective dodging (/burning) - but how do you make it look so natural / the transition not really count? Oh and this has to be jagar''s work if i''m not mistaken ;)', '2012-08-27 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850005, 1031084, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR.</td>', 'Nice HDR.', '2012-08-27 11:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
