(6850152, 1031013, 10785, '<td valign="top">Just a little too far from the action here. Hard to tell the subject from the crowd.</td>', 'Just a little too far from the action here. Hard to tell the subject from the crowd.', '2012-08-27 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850181, 1030798, 62357, '<td valign="top">I am afraid this does not work for me.  I find the processing to be overdone, the saturation is way too intense for my taste and there is a big halo around the lady in the purple.  The processing and the fact I am not really sure what the point of interest is in this image are why this is getting a low vote from me.</td>', 'I am afraid this does not work for me.  I find the processing to be overdone, the saturation is way too intense for my taste and there is a big halo around the lady in the purple.  The processing and the fact I am not really sure what the point of interest is in this image are why this is getting a low vote from me.', '2012-08-27 16:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850185, 1031084, 62357, '<td valign="top">This image has potential but it is far too over processed for my taste.  I have to say I would also prefer to see the busker from the front rather than the back, I''m sure it would make for a much more interesting photograph.</td>', 'This image has potential but it is far too over processed for my taste.  I have to say I would also prefer to see the busker from the front rather than the back, I''m sure it would make for a much more interesting photograph.', '2012-08-27 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850186, 1031196, 62357, '<td valign="top">This image seems a bit underexposed.  I wonder if it would be a more appealing image if you had shot it from the other direction so we could see their faces.  I''m not find the back view that interesting</td>', 'This image seems a bit underexposed.  I wonder if it would be a more appealing image if you had shot it from the other direction so we could see their faces.  I''m not find the back view that interesting', '2012-08-27 16:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850189, 1031287, 62357, '<td valign="top">Wonderful street portraiture.</td>', 'Wonderful street portraiture.', '2012-08-27 16:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850191, 1030674, 62357, '<td valign="top">Feels like a set up image and that doesn''t really work for me (in the context of this challenge at least)</td>', 'Feels like a set up image and that doesn''t really work for me (in the context of this challenge at least)', '2012-08-27 16:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850192, 1031172, 62357, '<td valign="top">I so wish this was shot from the front rather than the back, it would be much more interesting.  Well spotted though</td>', 'I so wish this was shot from the front rather than the back, it would be much more interesting.  Well spotted though', '2012-08-27 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850194, 1031266, 62357, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say about this one.  I think it has such a huge amount of potential. It''s a fabulous find, but I would LOVE to see those doggies in much more detail.  It would have had much more impact if you had shot from behind the girl with the phone (assuming, of course, that there was room).   The guy in the background adds nothing to this story.   As it stands this really misses somehow.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say about this one.  I think it has such a huge amount of potential. It''s a fabulous find, but I would LOVE to see those doggies in much more detail.  It would have had much more impact if you had shot from behind the girl with the phone (assuming, of course, that there was room).   The guy in the background adds nothing to this story.   As it stands this really misses somehow.', '2012-08-27 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
