(6850957, 1031023, 23484, '<td valign="top">amazing what you can do with slower shutter speeds.</td>', 'amazing what you can do with slower shutter speeds.', '2012-08-28 18:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850958, 1031063, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know if I would call this street photography but it''s a great image.</td>', 'I really don''t know if I would call this street photography but it''s a great image.', '2012-08-28 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850975, 1031086, 40391, '<td valign="top">A wonderful story has been captured here that is nicely balanced by the people walking away.  The processing is very well done and I really like the way you have made the ladies pop.  I feel it is almost over done with the far left ladys foot becoming almost unrealistically bright compared to the path.  I say almost, as it doesnt distract from the power of the image for me.  Well done!</td>', 'A wonderful story has been captured here that is nicely balanced by the people walking away.  The processing is very well done and I really like the way you have made the ladies pop.  I feel it is almost over done with the far left ladys foot becoming almost unrealistically bright compared to the path.  I say almost, as it doesnt distract from the power of the image for me.  Well done!', '2012-08-28 20:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850982, 1031282, 40391, '<td valign="top">Youve captured some great emotion here.  But I feel some of this has been lost with the composition and processing.  For me the central composition makes the image feel unbalanced and the oversaturation of the background colours is distracting.  I wonder if the image was cropped to lose most of the right hand part of the image and converting to b&amp;w may have accentuated the emotion of the couple more.  A nice street shot never the less.</td>', 'Youve captured some great emotion here.  But I feel some of this has been lost with the composition and processing.  For me the central composition makes the image feel unbalanced and the oversaturation of the background colours is distracting.  I wonder if the image was cropped to lose most of the right hand part of the image and converting to b&w may have accentuated the emotion of the couple more.  A nice street shot never the less.', '2012-08-28 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850988, 1031004, 40391, '<td valign="top">I like the camera shake, especially how it affects the lighting.  The leading lines towards the stares and people work well too.  Unfortunately, your choice of border is trying to be too much of a feature to me and distracts me from your image.  Ignoring the border (at least trying too) I quite like this image.</td>', 'I like the camera shake, especially how it affects the lighting.  The leading lines towards the stares and people work well too.  Unfortunately, your choice of border is trying to be too much of a feature to me and distracts me from your image.  Ignoring the border (at least trying too) I quite like this image.', '2012-08-28 20:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850992, 1031287, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, marvellous processing!  The way she is looking at him and their smiles creates a great portrayal of emotions.</td>', 'Wonderful capture, marvellous processing!  The way she is looking at him and their smiles creates a great portrayal of emotions.', '2012-08-28 20:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6850999, 1031184, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image really appeals to me.  Well composed and marvellous subjects.</td>', 'This image really appeals to me.  Well composed and marvellous subjects.', '2012-08-28 20:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6851000, 1031006, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and very well processed.  Great title too.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and very well processed.  Great title too.', '2012-08-28 20:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6851001, 1031281, 40391, '<td valign="top">Not what you would normally associate with street photography but this image is beautiful and intriguing.  It really appeals to me.</td>', 'Not what you would normally associate with street photography but this image is beautiful and intriguing.  It really appeals to me.', '2012-08-28 20:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6851005, 1031220, 40391, '<td valign="top">A truly beautiful and powerful image.  I wonder why she has such a concerned look.  The composition when I first looked felt a little off with her being so centred but when spending longer to absorb I now feel its just right.  Well done!</td>', 'A truly beautiful and powerful image.  I wonder why she has such a concerned look.  The composition when I first looked felt a little off with her being so centred but when spending longer to absorb I now feel its just right.  Well done!', '2012-08-28 20:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6851007, 1031079, 40391, '<td valign="top">An intriguing image that has life and movement.  I particularly like the two people bending over in opposite directions and the balanced composition with the door and lamps.  However, the over processing (particularly the sitting couple) takes the edge off this image for me.</td>', 'An intriguing image that has life and movement.  I particularly like the two people bending over in opposite directions and the balanced composition with the door and lamps.  However, the over processing (particularly the sitting couple) takes the edge off this image for me.', '2012-08-28 20:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6851009, 1031279, 40391, '<td valign="top">Overall, I really like this image.  Great composition, the silhouettes, shadows, reflecting lamp and deep blacks work together very well.  Intriguing!</td>', 'Overall, I really like this image.  Great composition, the silhouettes, shadows, reflecting lamp and deep blacks work together very well.  Intriguing!', '2012-08-28 20:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6851010, 1031135, 40391, '<td valign="top">This really is a truly wonderful landscape image.  It doesnt fall into the style of street photography for me however.  It is a pleasure to view though.</td>', 'This really is a truly wonderful landscape image.  It doesnt fall into the style of street photography for me however.  It is a pleasure to view though.', '2012-08-28 21:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
