(6851014, 1031271, 40391, '<td valign="top">Not what I would typically expect to see for street photography but I cant help but be captivated by this image.  Its simple yet its not.</td>', 'Not what I would typically expect to see for street photography but I cant help but be captivated by this image.  Its simple yet its not.', '2012-08-28 21:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
