(6851016, 1031084, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is one of the rare occasions (for me at least) that over processing an image works well.  It brings out the feel of the location in a way a painter would.  Well done.</td>', 'This is one of the rare occasions (for me at least) that over processing an image works well.  It brings out the feel of the location in a way a painter would.  Well done.', '2012-08-28 21:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
