(6851149, 1031063, 40391, '<td valign="top">Time to catch a ripple, thats what.  This is such a wonderful image that may not be getting the love it deserves.  Its normally hard to capture a story from the back of people but this image is a novel.  The processing really appeals to me with the right amount of desaturation and wonderful use of grain.  Youve brought the reflections ou nicely too.  Well done!<br/> <br/>Back to bump - my pick of the challenge.</td>', 'Time to catch a ripple, thats what.  This is such a wonderful image that may not be getting the love it deserves.  Its normally hard to capture a story from the back of people but this image is a novel.  The processing really appeals to me with the right amount of desaturation and wonderful use of grain.  Youve brought the reflections ou nicely too.  Well done! Back to bump - my pick of the challenge.', '2012-08-28 23:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
