(6852085, 1031167, 30982, '<td valign="top">Though I tend to do it a lot myself, shots of people''s backsides tend to be a bit less engaging than those that show facial expressions.  Also, on my monitor (which is pretty darn bright) there is quite a bit of artifacting in the sky.</td>', 'Though I tend to do it a lot myself, shots of people''s backsides tend to be a bit less engaging than those that show facial expressions.  Also, on my monitor (which is pretty darn bright) there is quite a bit of artifacting in the sky.', '2012-08-30 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852087, 1030798, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely afternoon, but feels more like a vacation photo than a "street shot" so to speak.  Processing is a little strong, creating haloes around the woman and some banding in the upper part of the sky.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely afternoon, but feels more like a vacation photo than a "street shot" so to speak.  Processing is a little strong, creating haloes around the woman and some banding in the upper part of the sky.', '2012-08-30 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
