(6852380, 1031085, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very funny moment. And they crossed the line which completes the story. Very well done.</td>', 'Very funny moment. And they crossed the line which completes the story. Very well done.', '2012-08-30 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
