(6853151, 1031085, 32011, '<td valign="top">A Melbournian!!... Nice image.  I love the juxtaposition of the newly weds with the advertising on the tram.</td>', 'A Melbournian!!... Nice image.  I love the juxtaposition of the newly weds with the advertising on the tram.', '2012-08-31 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853153, 1031229, 32011, '<td valign="top">This challenge is awash with Melbournians... great  colour and juxtaposition of statue and man.  Processing has created some haloing, which will hurt with the voters... also feel the crop, both top and bottom is going to cost you some points in the end... might have been worth your while to get on the ground and get the whole building in the background.</td>', 'This challenge is awash with Melbournians... great  colour and juxtaposition of statue and man.  Processing has created some haloing, which will hurt with the voters... also feel the crop, both top and bottom is going to cost you some points in the end... might have been worth your while to get on the ground and get the whole building in the background.', '2012-08-31 08:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853154, 1030674, 32011, '<td valign="top">Hosier''s lane... LOVE IT!  Love the motion and the desaturarion used to make the joker''s mouth standout... may have otherwise been lost with all the colours.  Look forward to seeing whose this is.</td>', 'Hosier''s lane... LOVE IT!  Love the motion and the desaturarion used to make the joker''s mouth standout... may have otherwise been lost with all the colours.  Look forward to seeing whose this is.', '2012-08-31 09:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
