(6853362, 1031079, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is quite good, almost spot lit, symmetrical and perfectly framed, a study in street life and movement.</td>', 'This is quite good, almost spot lit, symmetrical and perfectly framed, a study in street life and movement.', '2012-08-31 14:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853365, 1031160, 12611, '<td valign="top">I guess my only complaint might be that the reflection could hold something more mysterious and cool, but we can''t have everything, and the portrait is excellent.</td>', 'I guess my only complaint might be that the reflection could hold something more mysterious and cool, but we can''t have everything, and the portrait is excellent.', '2012-08-31 14:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853368, 1031004, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome hall shot. I always try but never can tale the long hall tunnel this well.</td>', 'Awesome hall shot. I always try but never can tale the long hall tunnel this well.', '2012-08-31 14:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853376, 1031287, 92847, '<td valign="top">Perfect B/W. Great smiles and very well composed photo.</td>', 'Perfect B/W. Great smiles and very well composed photo.', '2012-08-31 15:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853378, 1031181, 92847, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective with the fisheye. Good job!</td>', 'Very interesting perspective with the fisheye. Good job!', '2012-08-31 15:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853379, 1031302, 92847, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, the lady silhouette is perfectly  positioned against the vitrine. Great work!</td>', 'Nice contrast, the lady silhouette is perfectly  positioned against the vitrine. Great work!', '2012-08-31 15:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853380, 1030785, 92847, '<td valign="top">Great capture, tells a story.</td>', 'Great capture, tells a story.', '2012-08-31 15:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853384, 1031177, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve found my favorite for this challenge.  Nicely framed, clear, colorful without being overprocessed, and interesting subjects!  What is their body language saying?  It invites the viewer to wonder.</td>', 'I think I''ve found my favorite for this challenge.  Nicely framed, clear, colorful without being overprocessed, and interesting subjects!  What is their body language saying?  It invites the viewer to wonder.', '2012-08-31 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853393, 1030844, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and captured.  Did you try B&amp;W as the color here is a bit overpowering and detracts from the story.</td>', 'Nicely seen and captured.  Did you try B&W as the color here is a bit overpowering and detracts from the story.', '2012-08-31 16:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853394, 1030720, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the foregraound machine vs. the background man.  Perhaps one too many textures in the scene.  The man''s face is hard to make out and there is a slight tilt to the scene.</td>', 'I like the foregraound machine vs. the background man.  Perhaps one too many textures in the scene.  The man''s face is hard to make out and there is a slight tilt to the scene.', '2012-08-31 16:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853395, 1031133, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice outline of the man and details on the building.  Having trouble making the street connection.</td>', 'Nice outline of the man and details on the building.  Having trouble making the street connection.', '2012-08-31 16:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853396, 1030809, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and shot.  Not sure I like the lady''s odd expression as well as her lack of connection with the two sleepers.  The border is disctracting, go with something simple and let your photograph speak rather than the border.</td>', 'Nicely seen and shot.  Not sure I like the lady''s odd expression as well as her lack of connection with the two sleepers.  The border is disctracting, go with something simple and let your photograph speak rather than the border.', '2012-08-31 16:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853397, 1031281, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like it, as it is playful and moody at the same time.  Seems not to really fit most definitions of street photography.</td>', 'I like it, as it is playful and moody at the same time.  Seems not to really fit most definitions of street photography.', '2012-08-31 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853400, 1031086, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Each grouping tells a stor as the recide into infinity.  Not sure who declared letterbox borders a fashio statement, but I find is detracts from an excellent photo.</td>', 'Very nice.  Each grouping tells a stor as the recide into infinity.  Not sure who declared letterbox borders a fashio statement, but I find is detracts from an excellent photo.', '2012-08-31 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853403, 1031135, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpreation of the challenge, that may not really meet it.  I love the tones and texture.  The diagonals of the hills and the horizon are very nice.</td>', 'Interesting interpreation of the challenge, that may not really meet it.  I love the tones and texture.  The diagonals of the hills and the horizon are very nice.', '2012-08-31 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853404, 1031168, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like all the shadowplay here.  Not sure the partial desat (natural or photoshop) works here.  The man seems too still and is out of place.</td>', 'I like all the shadowplay here.  Not sure the partial desat (natural or photoshop) works here.  The man seems too still and is out of place.', '2012-08-31 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853405, 1031005, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice technicals on the pan. I think the backdrop here is too busy to be effective.  The tonality seems to be a little muted or off in some way.</td>', 'Nice technicals on the pan. I think the backdrop here is too busy to be effective.  The tonality seems to be a little muted or off in some way.', '2012-08-31 17:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853409, 1031120, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the 3 stories you caught here with each group.  The sign is a major distraction.  I also wish the yawn/sneeze was a smile or laugh so we could see his eyes.</td>', 'I like the 3 stories you caught here with each group.  The sign is a major distraction.  I also wish the yawn/sneeze was a smile or laugh so we could see his eyes.', '2012-08-31 17:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853411, 1031081, 91496, '<td valign="top">Good try at catching the moment.  Need visable eye or facial expressions here to add interest and create/capture the story.  Right now they are very static and I have little interest in them.</td>', 'Good try at catching the moment.  Need visable eye or facial expressions here to add interest and create/capture the story.  Right now they are very static and I have little interest in them.', '2012-08-31 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853412, 1031282, 91496, '<td valign="top">I think a tight crop to the couple is what is the story in this imgage.  The street scene here adds very little and detracts from the story.  Alternately a wider aperature could have blurred the background more to isolate them.</td>', 'I think a tight crop to the couple is what is the story in this imgage.  The street scene here adds very little and detracts from the story.  Alternately a wider aperature could have blurred the background more to isolate them.', '2012-08-31 17:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853413, 1031177, 91496, '<td valign="top">Well, I laughed.  Great expressions on the ladies.  Large pole makes an awkward composition that splits the image and makes the connection with the women more distant.  Perhaps a slight desat on the yellow channel could tome down the bright yellow shirt.  A vignette may also have given the image some pop.</td>', 'Well, I laughed.  Great expressions on the ladies.  Large pole makes an awkward composition that splits the image and makes the connection with the women more distant.  Perhaps a slight desat on the yellow channel could tome down the bright yellow shirt.  A vignette may also have given the image some pop.', '2012-08-31 17:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853414, 1031165, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the guitarist here.  Were you able to take any closeups of him.  Your subjects (man, shadow, guitarist) seem to compete with wach other rather than compliment each other,  perhaps because each is so small compared to the street and buildings.</td>', 'I like the guitarist here.  Were you able to take any closeups of him.  Your subjects (man, shadow, guitarist) seem to compete with wach other rather than compliment each other,  perhaps because each is so small compared to the street and buildings.', '2012-08-31 17:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853415, 1031023, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the out of the box thinking.  Not sure it works for me.  Perhaps crop aways most of the street and go for a paneled view.  Perhaps a B&amp;W or 80% desaturation would have let the shapes and tone speak rather than the too loud colors.</td>', 'I like the out of the box thinking.  Not sure it works for me.  Perhaps crop aways most of the street and go for a paneled view.  Perhaps a B&W or 80% desaturation would have let the shapes and tone speak rather than the too loud colors.', '2012-08-31 17:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853416, 1031196, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great idea with an intersting subjects.  Great diagonals and capture of all the dust.  I would love to see the view from the other side where the expression on the faces would be visable.  The backs of these guys is not where the story is.</td>', 'Great idea with an intersting subjects.  Great diagonals and capture of all the dust.  I would love to see the view from the other side where the expression on the faces would be visable.  The backs of these guys is not where the story is.', '2012-08-31 17:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853418, 1030676, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonals.  The subject women is great and you have caught an intersting expression.  The other 3 people in the scene add little and the boy is kind of distracting.  The DOF falls off slightly here.  I think you either need more DOF and keep everyone sharp or less DOF and isolate the single womam.</td>', 'Nice diagonals.  The subject women is great and you have caught an intersting expression.  The other 3 people in the scene add little and the boy is kind of distracting.  The DOF falls off slightly here.  I think you either need more DOF and keep everyone sharp or less DOF and isolate the single womam.', '2012-08-31 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853419, 1031061, 91496, '<td valign="top">Intersting, feels like 1970''s film.  The interaction of the people is great.  Pillers and yellow backdrop are kind of uninteresting.</td>', 'Intersting, feels like 1970''s film.  The interaction of the people is great.  Pillers and yellow backdrop are kind of uninteresting.', '2012-08-31 17:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853420, 1031161, 91496, '<td valign="top">Ouch, the thick white border is overkill.  A thin black one may have worked and made this look like a film strip.  Nice seeing.  I wish the women had turned slightly to give you more to work with.</td>', 'Ouch, the thick white border is overkill.  A thin black one may have worked and made this look like a film strip.  Nice seeing.  I wish the women had turned slightly to give you more to work with.', '2012-08-31 17:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853422, 1031002, 91496, '<td valign="top">You have nicely layered the groups of people here.  Unfortunately the expressions are all over the place and I do not get a sense of story from any of them.  This is a tough shot to pull off at times, beacuse of the random nature of people.</td>', 'You have nicely layered the groups of people here.  Unfortunately the expressions are all over the place and I do not get a sense of story from any of them.  This is a tough shot to pull off at times, beacuse of the random nature of people.', '2012-08-31 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853424, 1031287, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great tones and super story here.  His expression and presense is great.  She is ok,  but the her look is a little awkaward.</td>', 'Great tones and super story here.  His expression and presense is great.  She is ok,  but the her look is a little awkaward.', '2012-08-31 17:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853426, 1031013, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely down and kudo for looking for the new and interesting angle.  Not sure I like so much of the right hand statue as framing.  Perhaps a step to the left would have helped.  Also catching the performers dancing rather than bowing would add more impact.</td>', 'Nicely down and kudo for looking for the new and interesting angle.  Not sure I like so much of the right hand statue as framing.  Perhaps a step to the left would have helped.  Also catching the performers dancing rather than bowing would add more impact.', '2012-08-31 17:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853428, 1031271, 91496, '<td valign="top">There is swimming upstream and then there is swimming in the wrong ocean.  Nice shot, wrong challenge.</td>', 'There is swimming upstream and then there is swimming in the wrong ocean.  Nice shot, wrong challenge.', '2012-08-31 17:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853430, 1031184, 91496, '<td valign="top">What a wacky justoposition of elements.  I like it.   Minor areas for improvement.  Clone out crap in lower right and include more of the box the boy is sitting on.  The guy in the back rocks!!!</td>', 'What a wacky justoposition of elements.  I like it.   Minor areas for improvement.  Clone out crap in lower right and include more of the box the boy is sitting on.  The guy in the back rocks!!!', '2012-08-31 17:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853431, 1031126, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonals and layering of your subjects.  My eye is drawn to the bikini clad girl as opposed to your subjects.  The folks have to be intersting and tell a story to catch my eye.</td>', 'Nice diagonals and layering of your subjects.  My eye is drawn to the bikini clad girl as opposed to your subjects.  The folks have to be intersting and tell a story to catch my eye.', '2012-08-31 17:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853433, 1030967, 91496, '<td valign="top">Bizarre collections of shapes and writing.  I like it.  Not sure whether I like the pink/cream tonality.</td>', 'Bizarre collections of shapes and writing.  I like it.  Not sure whether I like the pink/cream tonality.', '2012-08-31 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853435, 1031160, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up and angle.  Interesting backdrop.  We just need a bike or skateboard or car visable in her glasses to compete the story.  The mirrored glasses replace her eyes and the eyes are the key to a good portrait.</td>', 'Nice close-up and angle.  Interesting backdrop.  We just need a bike or skateboard or car visable in her glasses to compete the story.  The mirrored glasses replace her eyes and the eyes are the key to a good portrait.', '2012-08-31 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853495, 1030944, 103142, '<td valign="top">Fun find! I wonder what it would look like with a portrait orientation. :)</td>', 'Fun find! I wonder what it would look like with a portrait orientation. :)', '2012-08-31 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853502, 1031287, 12611, '<td valign="top">a feel good shot. classic.</td>', 'a feel good shot. classic.', '2012-08-31 22:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853503, 1031177, 12611, '<td valign="top">awesome capture.</td>', 'awesome capture.', '2012-08-31 22:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853506, 1031285, 12611, '<td valign="top">excellent metal. so warm and rich.</td>', 'excellent metal. so warm and rich.', '2012-08-31 22:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853507, 1030898, 12611, '<td valign="top">I feel like I am there. Beautiful set up.</td>', 'I feel like I am there. Beautiful set up.', '2012-08-31 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853508, 1031268, 12611, '<td valign="top">The stroke and pathos of Jagar. Probably could not be done better. If the crowd is feeling intellectual/emotional in the least, its a ribbon.</td>', 'The stroke and pathos of Jagar. Probably could not be done better. If the crowd is feeling intellectual/emotional in the least, its a ribbon.', '2012-08-31 22:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853510, 1031301, 12611, '<td valign="top">reminds me of Boston, Faneuil hall. If it is, even if it isn''t, the spirit is captured.</td>', 'reminds me of Boston, Faneuil hall. If it is, even if it isn''t, the spirit is captured.', '2012-08-31 22:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6853511, 1031125, 12611, '<td valign="top">Wow- great capture, it all came together for you.</td>', 'Wow- great capture, it all came together for you.', '2012-08-31 22:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
