(6854871, 1031177, 58430, '<td valign="top">I really love this. It makes me wonder what it must be like to live like these two women live and to know the things they know and to experience the mundane with them.  What kind of dreams do these women have?  Are they merely surviving? What do they think about?  What do they feel?<br/> <br/>10 from me.</td>', 'I really love this. It makes me wonder what it must be like to live like these two women live and to know the things they know and to experience the mundane with them.  What kind of dreams do these women have?  Are they merely surviving? What do they think about?  What do they feel? 10 from me.', '2012-09-03 00:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854872, 1031063, 58430, '<td valign="top">I wish I could feel this comfortable in a swimsuit.  <br/> <br/>I like the composition and the colors but not a fan of the grain.  I almost think this would look better with a landscape crop but you probably couldn''t because of other people in the sides of the image.  What would have been really cool is seeing the full reflection of the woman too.<br/> <br/>10 from me.</td>', 'I wish I could feel this comfortable in a swimsuit.   I like the composition and the colors but not a fan of the grain.  I almost think this would look better with a landscape crop but you probably couldn''t because of other people in the sides of the image.  What would have been really cool is seeing the full reflection of the woman too. 10 from me.', '2012-09-03 00:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854874, 1030555, 54645, '<td valign="top">A murky committment. Well done.</td>', 'A murky committment. Well done.', '2012-09-03 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
