(6854878, 1031287, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s like there''s a wall here separating today from yesterday.  Although the man is holding a classic, he too looks like someone that was a strong part of that era.  What a wonderful blend of two worlds.</td>', 'It''s like there''s a wall here separating today from yesterday.  Although the man is holding a classic, he too looks like someone that was a strong part of that era.  What a wonderful blend of two worlds.', '2012-09-03 00:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
