(6855208, 1031086, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks - wonderful interaction and suggestion of stories in the lives of these people.  And I''ll bet you got very close if you knew the subject of their conversation - French people may be animated, but generally they are not loud when they are in public places.  That''s one thing Americans visiting France comment on - if they ever quiet down long enough to notice :)<br/>ETA Congratulations on the Blue, John!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-09-03 09:50:18.</i></td>', 'One of my top picks - wonderful interaction and suggestion of stories in the lives of these people.  And I''ll bet you got very close if you knew the subject of their conversation - French people may be animated, but generally they are not loud when they are in public places.  That''s one thing Americans visiting France comment on - if they ever quiet down long enough to notice :)ETA Congratulations on the Blue, John!', '2012-09-03 10:49:46.000000', '2012-09-03 10:50:18.000000', 0),
