(6855548, 1031282, 119667, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments, much appreciated. @ <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=138630" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nam</a>,<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=91496" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bobnospum</a>,<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=40391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">abra</a> - The shot is pretty much straight out of camera; I was going for a ''pure'' street photography shot with no PP, not even a crop. Maybe B&amp;W would have worked better, and, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=118154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tiny</a> the other shot would almost definitely have scored higher. What I get for making decisions an hour before cut off time (4 a.m. here!)</td>', 'thanks for all the comments, much appreciated. @  nam, bobnospum, abra - The shot is pretty much straight out of camera; I was going for a ''pure'' street photography shot with no PP, not even a crop. Maybe B&W would have worked better, and,  tiny the other shot would almost definitely have scored higher. What I get for making decisions an hour before cut off time (4 a.m. here!)', '2012-09-03 17:24:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6855549, 1031229, 101702, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 10''s... Really loved this shot and was my pick for the blue. You are right that there were a load of black ad white as usual, it was nice to see such a splash of colour in this shot. A shame you missed the top 10.</td>', 'I was one of your 10''s... Really loved this shot and was my pick for the blue. You are right that there were a load of black ad white as usual, it was nice to see such a splash of colour in this shot. A shame you missed the top 10.', '2012-09-03 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 0),
