(6855665, 1030785, 54778, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiteroom:</b></div><hr/><i> az? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would kill to get that comment from that commentor. Well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I at first thought it was a comment typo but now have seen the question mark. <strike>Curious very curious</strike>. Ah, figured it out.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-09-03 19:37:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by whiteroom: az?   I would kill to get that comment from that commentor. Well done.   I at first thought it was a comment typo but now have seen the question mark. Curious very curious. Ah, figured it out.', '2012-09-03 20:27:59.000000', '2012-09-03 20:37:22.000000', 0),
