(6855855, 1031177, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you kept it color. Sometimes the genre is so inundated with BW that we forget how great color really can be without being over the top saturated and crazy neon colored.</td>', 'I''m glad you kept it color. Sometimes the genre is so inundated with BW that we forget how great color really can be without being over the top saturated and crazy neon colored.', '2012-09-04 00:55:17.000000', NULL, 0),
