(6856081, 1031271, 117474, '<td valign="top">Sorry for late notice, but you got the asigmatic:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a></td>', 'Sorry for late notice, but you got the asigmatic:', '2012-09-04 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6856137, 1031086, 103142, '<td valign="top">I figured you''d be in the blue. :)<br/> <br/>What I like about the shot is that I would have a tendency to have cropped it just to the "gossipers". But leaving in the rest of the scene adds so much. Huge congrats!!</td>', 'I figured you''d be in the blue. :) What I like about the shot is that I would have a tendency to have cropped it just to the "gossipers". But leaving in the rest of the scene adds so much. Huge congrats!!', '2012-09-04 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6856187, 1030844, 112739, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the safety vest detracts from the story, it''s PART of the story. He''s a construction worker! The yellow bag and the red rimmed container all are part of the story and would not be of impact if this were in monochrome. Great work George, great timing and waiting for the right moment to open the shutter. Should have scored way higher, I think street photography is  misunderstood by most and not appreciated for the subtle aspects.</td>', 'I don''t think the safety vest detracts from the story, it''s PART of the story. He''s a construction worker! The yellow bag and the red rimmed container all are part of the story and would not be of impact if this were in monochrome. Great work George, great timing and waiting for the right moment to open the shutter. Should have scored way higher, I think street photography is  misunderstood by most and not appreciated for the subtle aspects.', '2012-09-04 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6856201, 1030958, 112739, '<td valign="top">Street photography is about capturing a scene that is usually accepted by more viewers if it has some unusual interest. It''s not about how the final image is processed. Street photography should be minimal editing, not advanced. Too many think it has to be some eye appealing thing, it does not. If this image makes you smile, then by all means, continue with what makes you smile.</td>', 'Street photography is about capturing a scene that is usually accepted by more viewers if it has some unusual interest. It''s not about how the final image is processed. Street photography should be minimal editing, not advanced. Too many think it has to be some eye appealing thing, it does not. If this image makes you smile, then by all means, continue with what makes you smile.', '2012-09-04 18:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6856363, 1031086, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know, I almost commented "This must be jagar''s" but then I remembered you were scoring so poorly and this had to be scoring well.  I wondered who was doing a great imitation of you!  Congrats on the blue in a challenge you naturally owned.  :-)</td>', 'You know, I almost commented "This must be jagar''s" but then I remembered you were scoring so poorly and this had to be scoring well.  I wondered who was doing a great imitation of you!  Congrats on the blue in a challenge you naturally owned.  :-)', '2012-09-04 22:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6856459, 1031261, 54645, '<td valign="top">Sly vs sly</td>', 'Sly vs sly', '2012-09-05 01:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
