(6991856, 1031229, 12611, '<td valign="top">I second the Mr. Bean theory. You have hit on the essence of dramatic, story based street photography, humans interacting with strange and wonderful environments.</td>', 'I second the Mr. Bean theory. You have hit on the essence of dramatic, story based street photography, humans interacting with strange and wonderful environments.', '2013-03-05 08:28:57.000000', NULL, 0),
